    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1042152d81df09a73178bd49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『阪神两岁雌马大赛』是\n每年12月在阪神比赛场举办的\n草地1600m的GⅠ比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b9507f4f53dd92ae6403baa5f4d3be6d5a673abc31a74adc0ac870836afc51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130303.json",
      "json_path": [
